      "evidence": "otion to the post of Major General also, it is clear that the petitioner did not approach the Central Government for redressal of his grievance under Section 21 of the Army Act. 23. Accordingly, it is a case where the petitioner did not avail the remedy under the Army Act at all. 24. It is not even a case where the petitione",
